Package: plskit
Type: Package
Title: PLS Regression with Modern Inference
Version: 0.7.1
Authors@R: person("Paweł", "Lenartowicz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "6quarg@gmail.com")
Description: PLS regression with modern inference: the 'split_exact'
    and 'split_nb' confirmatory tests and rotation-invariant
    subsampling confidence intervals. R wrapper around the Rust
    'plskit' engine via 'extendr'.
